<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Daimler, BMW.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Daimler, BMW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp says it has issued five million American-style call warrants, in five equal tranches. There are three tranche on Daimler-Benz AG and two tranches on Bayerische Motoren-Werke AG (BMW).</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS STRIKE	  ISS PRICE  PREMIUM    GEARING  MATURITY</p>
<p>DAIMLER-BENZ AG</p>
<p> CALL A     120.00 DEM  10.81 DEM  12.74 PCT  10.73 X  20.JAN.98</p>
<p> CALL B     130.00 DEM   7.21 DEM  18.25 PCT  16.09 X  20.JAN.98</p>
<p> CALL C     140.00 DEM   4.61 DEM  24.63 PCT  25.17 X  20.JAN.98</p>
<p>BMW AG</p>
<p> CALL D   1,100.00 DEM   6.99 DEM   7.23 PCT  15.61 X  08.AUG.97</p>
<p> CALL E   1,200.00 DEM   3.41 DEM  13.12 PCT  31.99 X  08.AUG.98</p>
<p> PAYDATE 23.JAN.97	LISTING FFT DDF	MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
